  "manifest": {
    "name": "dsh-plugin-model-news-radar",
    "version": "0.1.1",
    "description": "模型资讯雷达：按厂商官方来源清单（RSS、Hugging Face 与 GitHub 组织接口、变更页；自带 6 家示例清单，完整清单读 ~/.dsh/model-news-radar/sources.json）定时采集大模型发布资讯，去重后写成日报 / 周报 / 月报，并起一个 DSH 会话写摘要。只读，不登录任何平台，无第三方依赖。 · Scheduled model-news radar for DeepSeek Harness: collects official release announcements from LLM vendors through RSS, Hugging Face and GitHub organisation APIs and changelog pages (6-vendor sample list bundled, user list read from ~/.dsh/model-news-radar/sources.json), deduplicates them into daily / weekly / monthly Markdown reports and opens a DSH session that writes the summary. Read-only, no logins, no third-party dependencies.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "author": "805808786",
